%description:
An EPC carries IP sessions only: the core network (CoreControl) rejects an Unstructured
session whose anchor is a PGW, at the session's establishment.

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
network = simu5g.test.moduletest.lib.EpcSessionTestNetwork

*.ue[*].sessionType = "Unstructured"
*.ue[*].hasIpv4 = false
*.ue[*].numUnstructuredApps = 1
*.ue[*].unstructuredApp[0].source.packetLength = 100B
*.ue[*].unstructuredApp[0].source.productionInterval = 20ms
*.ue[*].unstructuredApp[0].source.initialProductionOffset = 0.1s

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%exitcode: 1
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stderr
CoreControl: EpcSessionTestNetwork.ue[0] requests a session of type "Unstructured", but its anchor EpcSessionTestNetwork.pgw is a PGW, whose EPC carries IP sessions only (see the UE's sessionType parameter)
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
